  "title": "Curated Himalayan Retreat Packages & Bespoke Stays",
  "html": "<main id=\"main-content\" class=\"w-full pt-28 bg-surface\"><div class=\"flex flex-col w-full\">\n<!-- Elevation & Topographic Metadata Banner -->\n<section class=\"w-full bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant py-3 px-6 border-b border-linen-border\">\n<div class=\"max-w-[1320px] mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 text-label-md font-label-md tracking-wider uppercase\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-pine-deep\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-cedar-gold text-[16px]\">landscape</span>\n<span>Sanctuary Elevation: 7,500 FT • Char Dukan Ridge • Curated Packages &amp; Residencies</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-mist-silver\">\n<span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">Above Char Dukan Ridge, Mussoorie</span>\n<span class=\"inline-block w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-cedar-gold\"></span>\n<span class=\"font-mono text-label-sm\">30.4598° N, 78.0934° E</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Editorial Grand Hero -->\n<section class=\"relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-pine-deep text-linen-base\">\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0\">\n<img sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 1100px) 65vw, 1100px\" srcset=\"/assets/a9df235a8a9522ba-480.webp 480w, /assets/a9df235a8a9522ba-960.webp 960w, /assets/a9df235a8a9522ba.webp 1376w\" height=\"768\" width=\"1376\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"eager\" alt=\"Light of Landour Terrace with Himalayan peaks and morning meditation\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-45 transform scale-105 transition-transform duration-[10000ms] ease-out hover:scale-100\" src=\"/assets/a9df235a8a9522ba.webp\">\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-pine-deep via-pine-deep/60 to-transparent\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-pine-deep/80 via-transparent to-pine-deep/40\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"relative max-w-[1320px] mx-auto px-6 pt-24 pb-20 md:pt-32 md:pb-28 flex flex-col items-start justify-end min-h-[640px]\">\n<div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-bright/10 backdrop-blur-md text-amber-gold-bright text-label-sm font-label-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-6 border border-amber-gold-bright/30\">\n<span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-gold-bright animate-ping\"></span>\n        Special Experience Packages • Wholehearted Living\n      </div>\n<h1 class=\"font-display text-display leading-tight max-w-4xl text-linen-base mb-4 tracking-normal\">\n        Unwind Your <span class=\"italic font-normal text-amber-gold-bright\">Happiness Story</span>\n</h1>\n<p class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-linen-subtle/90 max-w-2xl font-light mb-8\">\n        Curated Himalayan Retreat Packages &amp; Solitary Residencies\n      </p>\n<p class=\"font-body-lg text-body-lg text-linen-subtle/80 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed mb-10\">\n        When the world moves too fast, and you lose yourself in the chaos, introduce yourself to each color of the sunset. Reacquaint yourself with the earth beneath your feet and thank the air breeze which fills your life form. It's time to absorb the <span class=\"text-amber-gold-bright font-medium\">SHAKTI</span> of the unwinding universe. Tell us how we can help you explore within — no request is too big or too small.\n      </p>\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\">\n<a class=\"px-8 py-3.5 bg-cedar-gold text-on-secondary-fixed font-label-lg text-label-lg tracking-wider uppercase rounded-lg hover:bg-amber-gold-bright transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg shadow-cedar-gold/20 flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"#curated-packages\">\n          Explore All Packages\n          <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\">arrow_downward</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"px-8 py-3.5 bg-surface-bright/10 backdrop-blur-md text-linen-base border border-linen-border/40 font-label-lg text-label-lg tracking-wider uppercase rounded-lg hover:bg-surface-bright/20 transition-all duration-300 flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"#bespoke-builder\">\n          Design Custom Package\n          <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\">north_east</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Sanctuary Ribbon Metrics -->\n<div class=\"relative w-full bg-slate-charcoal/80 backdrop-blur-xl border-t border-linen-border/10\">\n<div class=\"max-w-[1320px] mx-auto px-6 py-6 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 border-r border-linen-border/10 last:border-r-0 pr-4\">\n<span class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-amber-gold-bright\">7,500 FT</span>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-linen-subtle/70\">Sanctuary Altitude</span>\n<span class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-linen-subtle/50\">Above cloudline &amp; Doon mist</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 border-r border-linen-border/10 last:border-r-0 pr-4\">\n<span class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-amber-gold-bright\">4 Curations</span>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-linen-subtle/70\">Signature Pathways</span>\n<span class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-linen-subtle/50\">Restorative, Prana, Solitude</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 border-r border-linen-border/10 last:border-r-0 pr-4\">\n<span class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-amber-gold-bright\">100% Organic</span>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-linen-subtle/70\">Glass Box Conservatory</span>\n<span class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-linen-subtle/50\">Full-board seasonal harvests</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 pr-4\">\n<span class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-amber-gold-bright\">Quiet Solitude</span>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-linen-subtle/70\">Silence Sanctuary</span>\n<span class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-linen-subtle/50\">10:00 PM digital detox protocol</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Interactive Package Category Filter Navigation -->\n<section class=\"w-full bg-surface py-12 px-6\" id=\"curated-packages\">\n<div class=\"max-w-[1320px] mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6 pb-6 border-b border-linen-border\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-label-md tracking-widest uppercase text-cedar-gold\">Alpine Retreat Frameworks</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary mt-2\">Curated Journeys for Body, Mind &amp; Space</h2>\n</div>\n<!-- Filter Tabs -->\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\" id=\"packageFilterGroup\">\n<button aria-label=\"All Packages\" class=\"filter-btn active px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-pine-deep text-linen-base font-label-md text-label-md tracking-wider uppercase transition-all duration-200\" data-filter=\"all\" type=\"button\">\n          All Packages\n        </button>\n<button aria-label=\"Renewal (5N/6D)\" class=\"filter-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md tracking-wider uppercase transition-all duration-200\" data-filter=\"wellness\" type=\"button\">\n          Renewal (5N/6D)\n        </button>\n<button aria-label=\"Residency (21D)\" class=\"filter-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md tracking-wider uppercase transition-all duration-200\" data-filter=\"residency\" type=\"button\">\n          Residency (21D)\n        </button>\n<button aria-label=\"Romance (3D/2N)\" class=\"filter-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md tracking-wider uppercase transition-all duration-200\" data-filter=\"couples\" type=\"button\">\n          Romance (3D/2N)\n        </button>\n<button aria-label=\"Weekend (2N/3D)\" class=\"filter-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md tracking-wider uppercase transition-all duration-200\" data-filter=\"weekend\" type=\"button\">\n          Weekend (2N/3D)\n        </button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Package Cards Mosaic -->\n<section class=\"w-full bg-surface px-6 pb-24\">\n<div class=\"max-w-[1320px] mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10\" id=\"packageGrid\">\n<!-- Package 1: The Himalayan Renewal -->\n<article class=\"package-card flex flex-col bg-linen-subtle rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500 border border-linen-border group\" data-category=\"wellness\">\n<div class=\"relative w-full h-80 overflow-hidden bg-surface-container-high\">\n<img sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 1100px) 65vw, 1100px\" srcset=\"/assets/a9df235a8a9522ba-480.webp 480w, /assets/a9df235a8a9522ba-960.webp 960w, /assets/a9df235a8a9522ba.webp 1376w\" height=\"768\" width=\"1376\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Morning terrace meditation overlooking snowcapped Garhwal peaks\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out\" src=\"/assets/a9df235a8a9522ba.webp\">\n<div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 bg-pine-deep text-linen-base px-3 py-1 text-label-sm font-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest rounded\">\n            Most Selected Pathway\n          </div>\n<div class=\"absolute bottom-4 right-4 bg-surface-bright/90 backdrop-blur-md px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-pine-deep font-mono text-label-md font-medium\">\n            5 Nights • 6 Days\n          </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col flex-grow justify-between gap-6\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"text-label-sm font-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-cedar-gold\">Holistic Recalibration</span>\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mt-1 mb-2\">The Himalayan Renewal</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed\">\n              Restorative recalibration through mountain air, botanical dining, circadian alignment, and quiet walks along ancient Garhwal bridle paths.\n            </p>\n<div class=\"mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-linen-border grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-body-sm font-body-sm text-on-surface\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-cedar-gold text-[18px]\">bed</span>\n<span>Mudra or Chakra Alpine Suite</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-cedar-gold text-[18px]\">restaurant</span>\n<span>Full-board at The Glass Box</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-cedar-gold text-[18px]\">spa</span>\n<span>3 Ayurvedic &amp; Sound Baths</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-cedar-gold text-[18px]\">hiking</span>\n<span>Guided Char Dukan &amp; Pari Tibba</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pt-6 border-t border-linen-border flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"text-label-sm font-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-mist-silver\">All-Inclusive Sanctuary Fee</span>\n<div class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-pine-deep\">₹58,000 <span class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">/ couple</span></div>\n</div>\n<a class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3 bg-pine-deep text-linen-base font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider rounded hover:bg-pine-muted transition-colors text-center\" href=\"#bespoke-builder\">\n              Reserve Renewal Package\n            </a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<!-- Package 2: Sacred Prana & Chakra Realignment (21 Days) -->\n<article class=\"package-card flex flex-col bg-linen-subtle rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500 border border-linen-border group\" data-category=\"residency\">\n<div class=\"relative w-full h-80 overflow-hidden bg-surface-container-high\">\n<div class=\"w-full h-full bg-cover bg-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out\" data-alt=\"Tibetan singing bowls, Himalayan brass meditation altar, warm cedarwood interiors with incense smoke drifting through sunlight beams, quiet library corner in Landour Mussoorie\" style=\"background-image: url('/assets/00f63b5bd4461607.webp')\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 bg-cedar-gold text-on-secondary-fixed px-3 py-1 text-label-sm font-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest rounded font-semibold\">\n            Limited to 4 Fellows per Season\n          </div>\n<div class=\"absolute bottom-4 right-4 bg-surface-bright/90 backdrop-blur-md px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-pine-deep font-mono text-label-md font-medium\">\n            21 Days Long-Stay\n          </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col flex-grow justify-between gap-6\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"text-label-sm font-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-cedar-gold\">Deep Immersion Residency</span>\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mt-1 mb-2\">Sacred Prana &amp; Chakra Realignment</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed\">\n              A profound transformational residency guided by resident Ayurvedic masters and Tibetan acoustic healers, designed for writers, thinkers, and seekers.\n            </p>\n<div class=\"mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-linen-border grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-body-sm font-body-sm text-on-surface\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-cedar-gold text-[18px]\">apartment</span>\n<span>Dual-Level European/Persian Duplex</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-cedar-gold text-[18px]\">psychology</span>\n<span>Private Himalayan Vaidya Care</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-cedar-gold text-[18px]\">self_improvement</span>\n<span>Daily Dawn Singing Bowl Prana</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-cedar-gold text-[18px]\">hot_tub</span>\n<span>Unlimited Cedarwood Herbal Soaks</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pt-6 border-t border-linen-border flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"text-label-sm font-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-mist-silver\">Residential Residency Tariff</span>\n<div class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-pine-deep\">₹2,10,000 <span class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">/ resident</span></div>\n</div>\n<a class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3 bg-pine-deep text-linen-base font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider rounded hover:bg-pine-muted transition-colors text-center\" href=\"#bespoke-builder\">\n              Apply For Residency\n            </a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<!-- Package 3: Romantic Alpine Solitude & Stargazing -->\n<article class=\"package-card flex flex-col bg-linen-subtle rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500 border border-linen-border group\" data-category=\"couples\">\n<div class=\"relative w-full h-80 overflow-hidden bg-surface-container-high\">\n<img sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 1100px) 65vw, 1100px\" srcset=\"/assets/4fd0ea3170d01d8f-480.webp 480w, /assets/4fd0ea3170d01d8f-960.webp 960w, /assets/4fd0ea3170d01d8f.webp 1200w\" height=\"896\" width=\"1200\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Couple wrapped in warm blankets stargazing through a brass telescope on stone terrace under milky way\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out\" src=\"/assets/4fd0ea3170d01d8f.webp\">\n<div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 bg-pine-deep text-linen-base px-3 py-1 text-label-sm font-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest rounded\">\n            Couples Intimate Getaway\n          </div>\n<div class=\"absolute bottom-4 right-4 bg-surface-bright/90 backdrop-blur-md px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-pine-deep font-mono text-label-md font-medium\">\n            3 Days • 2 Nights\n          </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col flex-grow justify-between gap-6\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"text-label-sm font-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-cedar-gold\">Celestial Serenade</span>\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mt-1 mb-2\">Romantic Alpine Solitude &amp; Stargazing</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed\">\n              Intimate mountain quietude with candlelight degustation, vintage brass telescope sessions under zero-light-pollution skies, and mulled hill wine.\n            </p>\n<div class=\"mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-linen-border grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-body-sm font-body-sm text-on-surface\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-cedar-gold text-[18px]\">balcony</span>\n<span>Duplex Alpine Valley Balcony</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-cedar-gold text-[18px]\">dinner_dining</span>\n<span>Juliet's Balcony 5-Course Dinner</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-cedar-gold text-[18px]\">qr_code_2</span>\n<span>Vintage Telescope Star Viewing</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-cedar-gold text-[18px]\">volunteer_activism</span>\n<span>Couples Cedar &amp; Hot Stone Therapy</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pt-6 border-t border-linen-border flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"text-label-sm font-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-mist-silver\">Curated Couple Tariff</span>\n<div class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-pine-deep\">₹32,500 <span class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">/ couple</span></div>\n</div>\n<a class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3 bg-pine-deep text-linen-base font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider rounded hover:bg-pine-muted transition-colors text-center\" href=\"#bespoke-builder\">\n              Reserve Romantic Escape\n            </a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<!-- Package 4: Weekend Deodar Solitude -->\n<article class=\"package-card flex flex-col bg-linen-subtle rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500 border border-linen-border group\" data-category=\"weekend\">\n<div class=\"relative w-full h-80 overflow-hidden bg-surface-container-high\">\n<img sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 1100px) 65vw, 1100px\" srcset=\"/assets/319bab2e6207f8b9-480.webp 480w, /assets/319bab2e6207f8b9-960.webp 960w, /assets/319bab2e6207f8b9.webp 1200w\" height=\"896\" width=\"1200\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Travellers walking peacefully through misty deodar pine forest trail in Landour Himalayas\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out\" src=\"/assets/319bab2e6207f8b9.webp\">\n<div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 bg-pine-deep text-linen-base px-3 py-1 text-label-sm font-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest rounded\">\n            Quick Mountain Pause\n          </div>\n<div class=\"absolute bottom-4 right-4 bg-surface-bright/90 backdrop-blur-md px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-pine-deep font-mono text-label-md font-medium\">\n            2 Nights • 3 Days\n          </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col flex-grow justify-between gap-6\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"text-label-sm font-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-cedar-gold\">Prompt Rejuvenation</span>\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mt-1 mb-2\">Weekend Deodar Solitude</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed\">\n              A prompt escape from urban chaos into the acoustic healing of century-old pine canopies, cedar hearths, and Ruskin Bond reading corners.\n            </p>\n<div class=\"mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-linen-border grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-body-sm font-body-sm text-on-surface\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-cedar-gold text-[18px]\">forest</span>\n<span>Element Room / Courtyard Cottage</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-cedar-gold text-[18px]\">bakery_dining</span>\n<span>Bakery High Tea &amp; Breakfast</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-cedar-gold text-[18px]\">directions_walk</span>\n<span>Guided Pine Forest Bathing</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-cedar-gold text-[18px]\">menu_book</span>\n<span>Curated Heritage Library Access</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pt-6 border-t border-linen-border flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"text-label-sm font-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-mist-silver\">Weekend Rest Tariff</span>\n<div class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-pine-deep\">₹21,000 <span class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">/ couple</span></div>\n</div>\n<a class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3 bg-pine-deep text-linen-base font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-wider rounded hover:bg-pine-muted transition-colors text-center\" href=\"#bespoke-builder\">\n              Book Weekend Getaway\n            </a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Audio-Visual Showcase Module: Rhythm of the Ridge -->\n<section class=\"w-full bg-slate-charcoal text-linen-base py-20 px-6 relative overflow-hidden\">\n<div class=\"max-w-[1320px] mx-auto flex flex-col items-center text-center\">\n<div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-bright/10 text-cedar-gold text-label-sm font-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">graphic_eq</span>\n        432Hz Acoustic Mountain Resonance\n      </div>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg max-w-3xl mb-4\">\n        The Rhythm of the Ridge: An Audio-Visual Himalayan Journey\n      </h2>\n<p class=\"font-body-lg text-body-lg text-linen-subtle/70 max-w-2xl mb-12\">\n        Listen to the mountain wind, cedar chimes, and early morning birdsong before your journey begins. A window into the stillness awaiting you at 7,500 feet.\n      </p>\n<!-- Video Player Frame Simulation -->\n<div class=\"relative w-full max-w-4xl aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-linen-border/20 group\">\n<img sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 1100px) 65vw, 1100px\" srcset=\"/assets/a9df235a8a9522ba-480.webp 480w, /assets/a9df235a8a9522ba-960.webp 960w, /assets/a9df235a8a9522ba.webp 1376w\" height=\"768\" width=\"1376\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Panoramic mountain vista with morning mist and cedar trees\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out opacity-85\" src=\"/assets/a9df235a8a9522ba.webp\">\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-charcoal via-slate-charcoal/30 to-transparent\"></div>\n<!-- Central Play Trigger -->\n<button data-photo-tour=\"\" aria-label=\"Explore photo tour\" class=\"absolute inset-0 m-auto w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-cedar-gold/90 text-on-secondary-fixed flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-md shadow-2xl hover:scale-110 hover:bg-amber-gold-bright transition-all duration-300\" id=\"videoPlayBtn\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\" aria-hidden=\"true\">photo_library</span></button>\n<!-- Media Controls Bar -->\n<div class=\"absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 p-6 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-charcoal via-slate-charcoal/90 to-transparent flex flex-col gap-3\">\n<div class=\"w-full bg-linen-base/20 h-1.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden cursor-pointer\" id=\"scrubBar\">\n<div class=\"bg-amber-gold-bright h-full w-2/5 transition-all duration-300\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-label-sm font-label-sm text-linen-subtle/80\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n<span class=\"font-mono\">Sanctuary photo collection</span>\n<span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">•</span>\n<span class=\"hidden sm:inline text-cedar-gold\">Live Wind Feed &amp; Garhwal Chimes</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] cursor-pointer hover:text-amber-gold-bright transition-colors\">volume_up</span>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] cursor-pointer hover:text-amber-gold-bright transition-colors\">fullscreen</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Interactive Custom Retreat Builder Section -->\n<section class=\"w-full bg-surface-container py-24 px-6\" id=\"bespoke-builder\">\n<div class=\"max-w-[1320px] mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-start\">\n<!-- Left Editorial Column -->\n<div class=\"lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-6\">\n<span class