xt-headline-sm text-primary\">Char Dukan</span>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-cedar-gold\">200m • 2 min walk</span>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">Century-old hill stalls serving lemon ginger tea, bun omelette, and mountain lore.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p-6 bg-linen-subtle rounded-xl border border-linen-border flex flex-col gap-3\">\n<div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-cedar-gold\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">church</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary\">St. Paul's Church</span>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-cedar-gold\">350m • 4 min walk</span>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">Historic 1839 Anglican stone sanctuary shaded beneath ancient cedar groves.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p-6 bg-linen-subtle rounded-xl border border-linen-border flex flex-col gap-3\">\n<div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-cedar-gold\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">visibility</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary\">Lal Tibba Peak</span>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-cedar-gold\">800m • 10 min stroll</span>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">Highest vantage peak in Mussoorie looking towards Badrinath &amp; Kedarnath ranges.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p-6 bg-linen-subtle rounded-xl border border-linen-border flex flex-col gap-3\">\n<div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-cedar-gold\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">shopping_basket</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary\">Sister's Bazaar</spa